### What the chapters of "The Ferry" share: the ferry cooperative's
### timetable and booking pages, lookout's README, a comment of the DNS zone.
### HTML tags, commands, addresses and paths are not translated.

ferry-zone-lookout-comment = islenet's monitoring box, lent to the cooperative
ferry-timetable-page =
