ferry-lookout-readme =
    lookout — islenet's monitoring box, on the internet

    From here, you see the members' servers the way the world sees them,
    in IPv4 and in IPv6: ping, ping6, curl -4 and -6, nc -zv, nmap (nmap -6
    for IPv6). Only probe your own server, please.

    Rangi
